@startuml
title 本機 Email 觸達寄送流程

actor "開發者" as Dev
participant "Campaign API / Scheduler / Domain Event Consumer" as Campaign
queue "Kafka\nreach.requested" as Kafka
participant "Reach Orchestrator" as Orchestrator
database "PostgreSQL\nreach_request / reach_task" as DB
participant "ReachTaskDispatcher" as Dispatcher
participant "EmailAdapter\n(circuit breaker)" as Adapter
participant "LocalSmtpEmailProviderClient" as Provider
participant "LocalEmailTemplateRenderer" as Renderer
participant "Spring Mail\nJavaMailSender" as MailSender
participant "Mailpit\nSMTP :1025 / UI :8025" as Mailpit

Dev -> Campaign: 建立或觸發 EMAIL reach
Campaign ->> Kafka: publish ReachRequested
Kafka ->> Orchestrator: consume ReachRequested
Orchestrator -> DB: upsert reach_request
Orchestrator -> DB: fan-out EMAIL reach_task(PENDING)

loop fixed-delay dispatcher poll
    Dispatcher -> DB: claim EMAIL task\nFOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
    DB --> Dispatcher: ClaimedTask(userId, templateRef)
    Dispatcher -> Adapter: send(ReachMessage)
    Adapter -> Provider: deliver(ReachMessage)
    Provider -> Renderer: render(message, now)
    Renderer --> Provider: subject + body
    Provider -> MailSender: send(from, fixed recipient, subject, body)
    MailSender -> Mailpit: SMTP DATA
    Mailpit --> MailSender: accepted
    MailSender --> Provider: message accepted
    Provider --> Adapter: SendResult(providerMessageId)
    Adapter --> Dispatcher: SendResult
    Dispatcher -> DB: markSent(taskId, providerMessageId)
end

Dev -> Mailpit: 開啟 http://localhost:8025 查看信件

note right of Provider
  固定 recipient 只存在本機 provider 設定。
  reach_task、Kafka event、ReachMessage
  不保存 email address。
end note

@enduml
